1.python3 -u -B /data2/pbx-acceptance-20261031/security-repair-f/k8s-31-32-20261110/interfaces/k8s_workflow.py --run r20261114-layout01 --scenario normal --concurrency    
K8s正常业务与真实并发
启动server、sender1、sender2、receiver真实业务Pod；两个计算节点训练/推理、监控摘要、双向确认、DAG、批次及链上终态；额外同步两个发送者产生真实重叠请求。

2.python3 -u -B /data2/pbx-acceptance-20261031/security-repair-f/k8s-31-32-20261110/interfaces/k8s_workflow.py --run r20261114-layout02 --scenario anomaly
